    },
    {
      "seq": 4,
      "who": "quill",
      "name": "Sir Quill",
      "text": "Whoever calleth thee cute. Lambs are cute. Thou art a plague year, fair one, in the best sense.",
      "mark": "charmed",
      "hits": [
        "flattery"
      ],
      "weight": 1,
      "round": 1
    },
    {
      "seq": 5,
      "who": "quill",
      "name": "Sir Quill",
      "text": "No invisible postman? Splendid. We shall court properly, by letter, passed through a hedge.",
      "mark": "cringing",
      "hits": [],
      "weight": 1,
      "round": 2
    },
    {
      "seq": 6,
      "who": "prince",
      "name": "Prince",
      "text": "Five dollars of bread for the swans. You feed them. They report to you now.",
      "mark": "cringing",
      "hits": [],
      "weight": 1,
      "round": 2
    },
    {
      "seq": 7,
      "who": "vex",
      "name": "Vex",
      "text": "No wifi, so I can't see you. Five dollars, a picnic, for whoever turns up. Possibly a Gerald.",
      "mark": "charmed",
      "hits": [],
      "weight": 1,
      "round": 2
    },
    {
      "seq": 8,
      "who": "quill",
      "name": "Sir Quill",
      "text": "Now, with the knaves dismissed, the candles low, and nothing between us but this helm, hello.",
      "mark": "cringing",
      "hits": [],
      "weight": 2,
      "round": 3
    },
    {
      "seq": 9,
      "who": "vex",
      "name": "Vex",
